sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.shift-swaps.index)"
    participant Controller as "Employee ShiftSwapController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik Batalkan Permintaan
    View->>Controller: POST /employee/shift-swaps/{id}/cancel
    Controller->>Model: cancelRequest(id, worker_id)
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_requests by id
    DB-->>Model: Data permintaan

    alt Data valid (status masih pending dan milik pegawai)
        Controller->>Model: Hapus/batalkan permintaan
        Model->>DB: UPDATE/DELETE shift_swap_requests
        DB-->>Model: Cancel success
        Model-->>Controller: Permintaan dibatalkan
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi pembatalan berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (status tidak bisa dibatalkan / bukan milik pegawai / id invalid)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal membatalkan permintaan
    end
